# The haze billboard. An emitter's material supplies only the map (its Kd is
# ignored - the emitter object's colour is the tint), and the corner UVs are
# fixed in the VU1 billboard program, so this file is one line that matters.
#
# puff.png is kept at RGBA32 by a per-asset textureQuality override in the
# .tyra: palettizing it would take the soft alpha through the tRNS->CLUT path
# and lose the gradient, leaving a hundred hard-edged squares.
newmtl haze
Kd 1 1 1
map_Kd puff.png
